  "name": "claude-opus-5",
  "displayName": "Claude Opus 5",
  "provider": "Anthropic",
  "description": "Claude Opus 5 is Anthropic’s flagship Opus-series model for advanced reasoning, coding, and high-value knowledge work, delivering frontier-level performance close to Claude Fable 5 at roughly half the cost. It supports text, image, and file inputs with text output, offers a 1M-token context window, and is well suited for complex software engineering, scientific research, and long-horizon agentic workflows.",
  "zhDescription": "Claude Opus 5 是 Anthropic 旗舰级 Opus 系列模型，专为高级推理、编码和高价值知识工作而设计，提供接近 Claude Fable 5 的前沿级性能，成本约为后者的一半。它支持文本、图像和文件输入以及文本输出，提供 100 万 token 的上下文窗口，非常适合复杂的软件工程、科学研究和长期代理工作流。",
  "longDescription": "Claude Opus 5 is Anthropic’s flagship Opus-series model for advanced reasoning, coding, and high-value knowledge work, delivering frontier-level performance close to Claude Fable 5 at roughly half the cost. It supports text, image, and file inputs with text output, offers a 1M-token context window, and is well suited for complex software engineering, scientific research, and long-horizon agentic workflows.",
  "zhLongDescription": "Claude Opus 5 是 Anthropic 旗舰级 Opus 系列模型，专为高级推理、编码和高价值知识工作而设计，提供接近 Claude Fable 5 的前沿级性能，成本约为后者的一半。它支持文本、图像和文件输入以及文本输出，提供 100 万 token 的上下文窗口，非常适合复杂的软件工程、科学研究和长期代理工作流。",
